step("Verify: EVEN/ODD/ROUNDUP/ROUNDDOWN round correctly")
expect(_eval("=EVEN(3.1)")).to_equal("4")
expect(_eval("=ODD(4)")).to_equal("5")
expect(_eval("=ROUNDUP(2.1)")).to_equal("3")
expect(_eval("=ROUNDDOWN(2.9)")).to_equal("2")
```

